CHAKRA NATURE TRANSFORMATION — TRAINING GUIDE
Konohagakure Jutsu Archive

Every shinobi has one or more affinities among the five basic natures:
Fire, Wind, Lightning, Earth, and Water. Nature transformation is the
molding of chakra into an elemental property.

Determining Affinity:
- Channel chakra into chakra-induction (litmus) paper. Fire ignites it,
  Wind splits it, Lightning wrinkles it, Earth crumbles it, Water dampens
  it. The reaction reveals the trainee's natural affinity.

Training Progression:
- Fire: burn a leaf held between the palms.
- Wind: split a leaf, then a waterfall (advanced).
- Lightning: crumple/crackle a leaf; discharge into a target.
- Earth: soften and reshape a stone.
- Water: draw moisture and shape it.

Guidance: Master a single nature before pursuing a second. Combining two
natures for a kekkei genkai effect is beyond ordinary training and inborn
for most. Practice under Jonin supervision.
